The ninth edition of the Sindh Literature Festival (SLF) will take place at the historic Mohatta Palace in Karachi on November 21 and 22, 2026, bringing together literature, culture, history and the stories that connect communities across Sindh.
The dates and venue were announced on the festival&rsquo;s official Instagram account, which invited audiences to join the two-day gathering celebrating the province&rsquo;s literary and cultural heritage. The announcement marks the return of the festival for its ninth edition, continuing an initiative that has provided a platform for writers, poets, scholars, artists and readers to engage with Sindh&rsquo;s diverse cultural traditions.
&nbsp;
